l |\n| Rustomjee Meridian Status | Ready To Move |\n| Rustomjee Meridian Launch Date | 01 January 2012 |\n| Rustomjee Meridian Possession Date | 01 July 2016 |\n| Towers in Rustomjee Meridian | 2 |\n\nRustomjee Meridian is a well-known project located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, offering premium properties in the price range of Rs. 1.13 Cr - 17.03 Cr. The luxurious project is designed and developed by Rustomjee, that is known for delivering quality projects. As of the latest update, the project is in the Ready To Move phase. It is planned over a total area of 1 Acre. The project features a total of 160 units.  \n  \nThe project is designed across 2 towers. The project was launched officially in January 2012.The commencement certificate has been granted of Rustomjee Meridian. Rustomjee Meridian Building, Charkop Village, Charkop Gaon, Kandivali, W, Maharashtra 400067 is the full address of the site. The project falls under the pincode 400067. If you go ahead with a home loan, the EMI may come to around Rs. 65,812/month for 30 years. Presently, 4 properties are available for purchase through owners and dealers, offering multiple options to explore. Gagangiri Anvaya, Dimple Westwood, Sri Arthaya, Shreeji Aikyam, Gagangiri Aadhya are several nearby under-construction projects. Hariko Skylon Suburbia, Gauri Excellency, Ruparel Sky Greens, Siddha Seabrook, Parinee Essence are some prominent ready-to-move societies nearby.  \n  \n\n### Rustomjee Meridian Brochure\n\nTo get detailed and comprehensive information about Rustomjee Meridian you can download the brochure PDF. The 'Download Brochure' link can be seen at the top right side of the page and can easily be downloaded from here. To view the Rustomjee Meridian brochure PDF, fill in your details like name, contact number, and email ID.  \n  \n\n### How is the Kandivali West Real Estate Market?\n\nAs of the July 2026 quarter, the average price of a multistorey apartment in Kandivali West stands at Rs. 20,774/sq. ft, and the property price ranges between Rs. 15,462 and Rs. 26,086/sq. ft, catering to a wide range of homebuyers and investors. At present, rental yield in the Kandivali West area of Mumbai is 3.25% for residential properties. As indicated by 367 resident feedback, Kandivali West has a rating of 4.34/5.You can explore Charkop Market and Akruti Shopping Centre for shopping and entertainment options.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nJogging and Strolling Track\n\n★\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nLift\n\nReserved Parking\n\nPiped Gas\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\nGrand Entrance lobby\n\nSpecifications & Key USPs of\n\nRustomjee Meridian\n\nSpecifications\n\nKey USPs\n\n* UPVC, aluminium sliding windows with reflective tinted glass\n* Modular switches\n* Ceramic tile flooring in bathrooms\n* Vitrified tiles in living room, bedroom and passage\n* Granite kitchen platform and SS sink\n* Water purifier and exhaust fan\n* Premium bath fittings and sanitary ware\n* Water heater and exhaust fan\n* Dry balcony with provision for washing machine\n\n* Malad 4 km | 20 min\n* Kandivali 5 km | 25 min\n* Borivali Railwa. 5 km | 25 min\n* Don Bosco High. 3 km | 15 min\n* Raghuleela Mall 4 km | 20 min\n* Thakur College. 2 km | 15 min\n* Atharva College. 3 km | 15 min\n* Evershine Mall 4 km | 20 min\n* Kharodi 5 km | 25 min\n* Babhai Naka 4 km | 20 min\n* Shankar Pada 4 km | 20 min\n* Ashtavinayak Na. 3 km | 15 min\n* 15 mins. from Kandivali Station.\n* 15 mins. from Kandivali Station.\n* 10 mins. from Link Road.\n* 15 mins. from Raghuleela Mall.\n* 5 mins. from Bus Stand.\n* 5 mins. from Autorickshaw Stand.\n\nWhat People Say\n\nOverall\n\nPositive\n\nNeeds Improvement\n\nThe gated society offers strong security, ample parking, a well-equipped gym, and a safe children's play park. The flats are well-constructed with no moisture issues, and the area is breezy, clean, and conveniently located near shops. However, it is far from the railway station, with limited late-night transportation options, making access to rickshaws challenging. Overall, it is a desirable and peaceful community.Read Less\n\nThe gated society features robust security with guards, CCTV, and ample parking. It offers a well-equipped gym, a safe play park for children, and reliable power backup. The flats are well-constructed with no moisture issues. The area is breezy, trustworthy, and conveniently located near grocery and medical shops. The community is peaceful, clean, and well-organized, with good connectivity and a well-maintained garden. Overall, it is a desirable place to live.Read Less\n\nThe building is located far from the railway station, with the nearest bus stop a 10-minute walk away. Late-night transportation options are limited, making it difficult to find rickshaws. Additionally, the maintenance costs are relatively high.Read Less\n\nAI generated summary from Magicbricks reviews and on-ground insights.\n\nAmple parking\n\nWell-maintained parks\n\nPower backup\n\nConstruction quality\n\nPublic transport\n\nMaintenance charges\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Rustomjee Meridian\n\nProject\n\nLocality\n\n4.2\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(1 Total Ratings)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nProject Infrastructure\n\n4.8/5\n\nWater Supply\n\nMain Electricity\n\nPower Back Up\n\nSewage Handling\n\nProject Amenities\n\n4.5/5\n\nSports Facility\n\nParking Facility\n\nGarden of Greenery\n\nShops within Premises\n\nProject Maintenance\n\n3.3/5\n\nConstruction Quality\n\nCommon Area Maintenance\n\nAvailablity of Service\n\n24/7 Security\n\nBuyer Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n26/04/2021\n\nNice project.\n\nThis is new residential building build by rustomjee builders at m g road charkop village kandiwali w... Show More\n\nRating and Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n26/04/2021\n\nNice project.\n\nThis is new residential building build by rustomjee builders at m g road charkop village kandiwali w... Show More\n\n4.3\n\nAverage Rating\n