e lines of Mumbai local trains -the Harbour Line Mumbai. The Harbour Line splits into two from Wadala Road, with one line heading to Navi Mumbai and another to Goregaon. Learn more.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/harbour-line-mumbai/131092.html)\n\n[![Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More\")\n\nCentral Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More\n\nThe Mumbai Central Line is a very vital suburban railway network within the city, with routes from CSMT to Kalyan, Kasara and Khopoli. Learn the details regarding the routes, stations, train timings, fare structure and interchange points.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/central-line-mumbai/131048.html)\n\n[![Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line\")\n\nMumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line\n\nVersova Ghatkopar Metro Route, or the Mumbai Metro Line 1, connects the central and western suburbs. The Mumbai metro Line 1 is fully operational and was one of the first lines to be operational in Mumbai. Know more about Versova Andheri Ghatkopar Metro - also called the Reliance Metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route/131129.html)\n\n[![Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B\")\n\nYellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B\n\nThe Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai/130113.html)\n\n[![Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More\")\n\nWestern Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More\n\nThe local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/western-line-mumbai/131117.html)\n\n[![Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?\")\n\nMumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?\n\nIndia's luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here's a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb/151181.html)\n\n[![Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27\")\n\nReady Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27\n\nReady reckoner in Mumbai is affected by the age and location of the property. Also, I know how to check the ready reckoner rate on the Maharashtra government website.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/ready-rekoner-rates-in-mumbai/118403.html)\n\n[![Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule\")\n\nMumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule\n\nThe upcoming Mumbai Ahmedabad bullet train transforms connectivity, boosts property values, and opens new real estate investment hubs across tier-2 cities along its 508 km corridor.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-ahmedabad-bullet-train-jkmb/150885.html)\n\n[![Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Applicatio