b.webp)![](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/5135/5135-oth-sample---hall_thumb.webp)\n\n## Quick facts\n\n₹11,500/sq.ft\n\nSold Out\n\nZone Avg Rate\n\n₹30,504/sq.ft · 372 projects\n\nKandivali West, Charkop Village, Off M G Road, Near Charkop\n\n## Building overview\n\nLocation\n\nKandivali West\n\nSub-Location\n\nCharkop Village, Off M G Road, Near Charkop\n\nStatus\n\nSold Out\n\nRate\n\n₹11,500/sqft\n\nType\n\nResidential\n\nFloors\n\n20\n\n### How prices stack up in Kandivali West\n\nFrom MPE live listings · your own data\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sq.ft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sq.ft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross rental yield\n\n3.6% / yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nGovernment circle rate here is **₹15,418/sq.ft** — the market trades **65% above** the official rate. [Ready reckoner rates ›](/ready-reckoner-rates-mumbai)\n\nMedians from MPE listings over the last 18 months. [See the Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\nMPE insight\n\nTiming can matter as much as location\n\nMumbai is supply-constrained, so the best pricing and unit choice often go early — well before the launch advertising. If you’re serious about a project, it pays to know where it is in its cycle. [Read the guide ›](/guides/mumbai-real-estate-timing-and-early-access)\n\n[Ask MPE on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20am%20considering%20Rustomjee%20Meridian%20in%20Kandivali%20West.%20Where%20is%20it%20in%20its%20cycle%2C%20and%20what%20are%20the%20best%20options%20right%20now%3F)\n\n## Building description\n\n### Building details\n\nRustomjee Meridian is one of the projects developed by Rustomjee, located in the Heart of Kandivali. The Location of Ready Possession project is located Near Charkop Village, off MG Road in Kandivali West. The Project is a 20 storeyed tower, that comprises of 1 BHK and 2 BHK flats with the carpet areas for 1 BHK is 499sq.ft and 2 BHK is 640sqft. It also has the ample car parking. The project is consist of various modern amenities like Grand Entrance Lobby, Gymnasium, Landscaped Garden, etc. are designed to avail the Home Buyers. Rustomjee Meridian Mumbai is fully approved project by all leading banks and is in Ready Possession with OC. The residential property has good connectivity with S.V Road and Link Road close. It also has good transportation facilities, the project is a just 15 min distance away from Kandivali Station and 5mins from Bus stand. Location of Rustomjee Meridian has a good social infrastructure and Hospitals such as; Mangal Murti Hospital, Zenith Hospital, etc. Schools such as Kapol Vidhyanidhi High School, St. Joseph School, etc. is in close proximity. Residents of Rustomjee Meridian will also enjoy the shopping with Sunray Shopping Malls, D Mart, Raghu Leela Mall, etc. in the close vicinity in Kandivali West. The bookings for Rustomjee Meridian is open, For Floor Plan, Booking, Site Visit and Cost Sheet of the project, please contact Mrs.Indu Sadh – . Mumbai Property Exchange is authorized channel partner of Rustomjee for the Ready Possession Project Rustomjee Meridian.\n\n### Building remarks\n\nFor 1 bhk rate Rs.12000/- & 2 bhk = 11500\n\n### Building ratings\n\n4.5\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nBuilding\n\n8.4\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLocation\n\n7.9\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nAmenities\n\n7.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLegal\n\n6.1\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nValue for Money\n\n## Rustomjee\n\n**Developer:** [Rustomjee](/projects-in-rustomjee)\n\n### More by Rustomjee\n\n[33 Fifteen, Bandra West](/project/33-fifteen-bandra-west/33570)[Rustomjee Yazarina III, Dadar](/project/rustomjee-yazarina-iii-dadar/33326)[Rustomjee Vista Bay, Sewri](/project/rustomjee-vista-bay-sewri/33305)[Rustomjee Uptown Urbania | La Vie, Thane West](/project/rustomjee-uptown-urbania-la-vie-thane-west/31841)[Rustomjee Aden, Bandra East](/project/rustomjee-aden-bandra-east/31840)[Rustomjee Crescent, Bandra West](/project/rustomjee-crescent-bandra-west/31839)[Rustomjee Urban Woods - Palm, Dombivli](/project